    "The observed API envelope is wall time, not GPU utilization.",
    "CPU, wait, GPU sum/union/span overlap and must not be added as disjoint costs.",
    "Completion callbacks and raw timing logging perturb the diagnostic worker; its FPS and variation cannot replace unmodified-worker scores.",
    "GPU command-buffer envelopes include scheduling/preemption effects; they do not identify GPU frequency, competing GPU clients or memory-bandwidth causes.",
    "Process snapshots and pre-round load are contextual observations, not causal proof.",
    "A single fixed-arm case, even when stable, cannot freeze the four-case formal B_ref."
